# Surface plan paths

Whenever you create or update a plan (CreatePlan or editing a `.plan.md` file), include its full absolute path in the reply to the user, every time.

Example:

> Plan: `/Users/cswapp/.cursor/plans/shizen_note_webhook_38572635.plan.md`
